  "PR_body": {
    "updated_at": "2026-10-09T08:35:14Z",
    "complete_original_body": "## Why\n\nThe original task ledger still points mainly to earlier preparatory work, while the original 275e component evidence has now been received and independently checked. Readers need those accepted results and the remaining dependency gap in the task records themselves.\n\n## Changes\n\nAppend one evidence record to each of P8-005 through P8-013 and P8-016, with immutable links to the published Round 19 archive and the earlier CI record. Eight successor tasks have their own scoped evidence accepted. The scale records retain the actual partial result: three of 150 original shards, 32 samples and five capacity receipts; the full original aggregate has not run.\n\nRegenerate the four existing progress views from the same ledger data. The original 192 tasks, all existing history, acceptance criteria, hard dependencies, statuses and navigation remain as recorded: 163 done, 16 in_progress, 12 todo and 1 blocked; 29 remain and this PR closes zero tasks.\n\n## Validation\n\nThe V8 formatting port reproduces all four existing views byte for byte from the original ledger. Removing only the ten appended records restores the complete original ledger bytes. This preparation is not a claim that Python or repository CI has already run. The PR's unchanged CI must execute the original scripts/code_index_plan.py and scripts/p8_facts.py --check and all other applicable checks.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- [Round 19 frozen original component receptions](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/blob/cd92ce4b931e770994770ba3dba6fd0a47a505ea/artifacts/checkpoints/p8-round19-evidence-20261009/README.md)\n- [Round 18 original CI and preserved earlier failed study](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/blob/f17b9c41df39972d31d67cfe510d53e6840f92c9/artifacts/checkpoints/p8-round18-evidence-20261009/README.md)\n- [Original 275e formal run](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/actions/runs/37896198208)\n\nThe measured source and original failures remain explicit. This documentation update does not grant release, live-provider or full-scale acceptance.\n",
    "bytes": 2025,
    "sha256": "de90cd96eb6ed63adb7d9081a12a496516061dbefbe62300f2dd1dbdca7623f1"
  },
